Source: libpve-storage-nonraid-perl
Section: perl
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Sveinbjörn Geirsson <sveinbjorn@sveinbjorn.dev>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
# Nothing here needs to be built as root or own a file it does not create:
# every path is a plain root:root file that dh_installdeb and
# 'dpkg-deb --root-owner-group' handle on their own. Declaring that means the
# build needs no root emulation at all, so the '-rfakeroot' the Makefile passes
# is a no-op rather than a dependency - and fakeroot is only a *Recommends* of
# dpkg-dev, so it is genuinely absent under --no-install-recommends.
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/Raudbjorn/nonraid

Package: libpve-storage-nonraid-perl
Architecture: all
Depends: ${perl:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
 libpve-storage-perl (>= 9.0~),
 nonraid-tools,
 mergerfs
Recommends: nonraid-dkms
Description: NonRAID storage plugin for Proxmox VE
 Exposes a NonRAID array as Proxmox VE directory-backed storage: on
 activation the plugin starts the array via nmdctl, mounts the member
 disks and unions them into a mergerfs pool. Includes an optional web
 UI integration that adds a NonRAID entry to the Add Storage menu.
